        {
          "text": "Amwiinde, amwiinde mumilyango, mubambile bantu bangu inzila. Amutuntumike, amutuntumike mitundulu, amugwisye mabwe mumugwagwa, amusumpwide bamasi indembela. ",
          "type": "text",
